    "turn_text": "Well, I didn't know Miss Sandy, but I have absolutely no doubt that she is incredibly honored and proud by the way you are continuing this. And I mean, you have been increasingly personal in how you've been creating that space in the light of her legacy. You mentioned coming forward and being public about Alopecia and, you know, revealed, you know, your beautiful look to the world. And it's been a little over a year since you did that. How does it feel now versus a year ago?",
