    "turn_text": "Yes, that's exactly how they say it. And, you know, Brittany, I look, there are a lot of incredible units out there in wigs. And I did all of that. I mean, I've done extensions and weaves and wigs. And, you know, I had a little shot a ponytail back in the day. You can tell me",
